            <td class="mt-align-center mt-noheading lt-chem-31454" style="vertical-align:middle;"><img alt="A silhouette of a bird in flight, depicted in black against a light background." style="width: 97.9972px; height: 62.9972px;" class="internal" loading="lazy" width="97.9972px" height="62.9972px" src="https://chem.libretexts.org/@api/deki/files/381150/kekule_structure_of_trans-but-2-ene.svg?revision=1" /><br />
            <br />
            <em>trans</em>-but-2-ene</td>
